Editorial is merged to main for development but is NOT release-ready.

Release gate:
1. From an independent attacker container, verify the complete historical
   Git credential -> prod account -> genuine GitPython-to-root sequence.
2. Verify the per-instance Root Flag is recovered through that path, not
   read using root-side docker exec or an assertion against a version string.
3. Validate Worker isolation, answer invalidation after reset and resource limits.
4. Confirm all acceptance tests pass on the final candidate revision.

Until the release gate has passed, the shared image publishing workflow
must refuse manual GHCR publication of this lab.
